  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Redline catalogue",
    "overview": "A poppy hardware magazine with the character of retro console menus and racing graphics: condensed headlines, signal-red actions, electric-blue selections and real hardware photography. Broad neutral fields and generous gaps give each object and idea room.\n\nBrowsing starts on paper white; the builder starts on charcoal. An explicit saved or session theme choice takes precedence over these route defaults. Reading and operating surfaces share type and control geometry while keeping their own useful density.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Heavy condensed display type with clear, relaxed reading text.",
